  ],
  "slug": "stick-to-your-choice",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/3246_stick-to-your-choice.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Once, three brothers left the countryside for the city, hoping to build businesses of their own. After overcoming many difficulties, they finally reached a bustling town. Three roads led out of the town. People said only one reached the city, but no one knew which one it was. Each brother chose a different road. Thirty years later, the two older brothers were still living in poor mountain villages, while the youngest had a company of his own. As it turned out, all three roads were difficult, full of challenges and hardship. The older brothers doubted their choices, so they gave up when they ran into trouble. But the youngest never forgot an elder’s advice: “Follow the path you believe is right.” He trusted his choice and kept going to the end.",
    "In fact, every road could lead to the city. Follow the path you believe is right, and keep going. You are sure to succeed."
  ],
  "english_full": "Once, three brothers left the countryside for the city, hoping to build businesses of their own. After overcoming many difficulties, they finally reached a bustling town. Three roads led out of the town. People said only one reached the city, but no one knew which one it was. Each brother chose a different road. Thirty years later, the two older brothers were still living in poor mountain villages, while the youngest had a company of his own. As it turned out, all three roads were difficult, full of challenges and hardship. The older brothers doubted their choices, so they gave up when they ran into trouble. But the youngest never forgot an elder’s advice: “Follow the path you believe is right.” He trusted his choice and kept going to the end.\n\nIn fact, every road could lead to the city. Follow the path you believe is right, and keep going. You are sure to succeed.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Одина́жды три бра́та у́шли из се́льской ме́стности в го́род, наде́ясь постро́ить свои́ бизнéсы. После преодоле́ния мно́гих сло́жностей они́ наконе́ц до́шли до переполоха́ и суеты́ города. Три доро́ги вели́ из города. Лю́ди ска́зали, что только одна дорога доходит до го́рода, но никто́ не знал, какой из них. Каждый брат выбрал другую доро́гу. Тридцать лет по́зже два ста́рших брата всё ещё жи́ли в бедных го́рах, в то вре́мя как са́мый мла́дший имел свою́ компа́нию. Как ока́залось, все три доро́ги были́ тру́дными, полными вызовов и невзгод. Ста́ршие братья сомнева́лись в своём вы́боре, поэтому они́ сдались, когда столкну́лись с затрудне́нием. Но мла́дший никогда́ не забы́вал сове́т ста́ршего: «Следуй по той тропе́, в ко́торую ты веришь». Он довере́л своему́ вы́бору и шёл до конца́.",
    "В действи́тельности каждая дорога могла́ привести́ в го́род. Следуй по той тропе́, в ко́торую ты веришь, и продолжай идти́. Ты обя́зательно преуспе́ешь."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Odinázhdy tri bráta úshli iz sélskoj méstnosti v górod, nadéjás' postróit' svoí bíznesy. Poslé preodoléniya mnógikh slózhnostej oní nakonéc dóshli do perepolókha i súety góroda. Tri dorógi velí iz góroda. Ljudí skázali, chto tól'ko odná doroga dokhódit do góroda, no niktó ne znál, kakój iz nikh. Kázhdy brat výbral drugúyu dorógu. Tridtsát' let pózhde dva stárshikh bráta vsyo eshchó zhíli v bédnykh górah, v to vré́mya kak sámyj mládsij imél svóyu kompániyu. Kak okázalos', vse tri dorógi bylí trudnymi, pol'nymi výzovov i nevzgód. Stárshie bráta somnevális' v svoém výbore, poetomu oný sdális', kogdá stolknúlis' s zatrudnéniyem. No mládsij nikogdá ne zabýval sovét stárshégo: «Sledúy po toj tropé, v kotoruyu ty verísh'». On doverél svoému výboru i shél do kontsa.",
    "V deystvítelnósti každaya doróga moglá privéstí v górod. Sledúy po toj tropé, v kotoruyu ty verísh', i prodolzháj idti. Ty obyázatel'no preuspésh!"
  ],
